PR #2494  overall: potential_risk
Spec: Changing pointer-masking PMLEN without TLB invalidation creates stale GPA-to-SPA mappings under two-stage translation, and HLVX.* instruction-fetch emulation must never apply pointer masking to prevent fetching from attacker-controlled aliased addresses.
